l":"https://api.github.com/users/mtakahar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mtakahar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"renamed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2024-04-19T00:53:44Z","rename":{"from":"[YSQL][randgen] variable not found in subplan target list","to":"[YSQL][randgen] ERROR: variable not found in subplan target list"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/2087029717","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/22062#issuecomment-2087029717","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/22062","id":2087029717,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBlCVUc58ZYvV","user":{"login":"timothy-e","id":26841748,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxNzQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841748?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e","html_url":"https://github.com/timothy-e","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-04-30T20:09:58Z","updated_at":"2024-04-30T20:09:58Z","body":"It's a bitmap scan problem:\r\n```sql\r\nSET yb_enable_expression_pushdown = false\r\n```\r\nthen rerunning the query shows the plan:\r\n```\r\n                                                                                                                                         QUERY PLAN\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n Nested Loop\r\n   ->  YB Bitmap Table Scan on t1 table1\r\n         ->  BitmapOr\r\n               ->  Bitmap Index Scan on t1_col_varchar_key_idx\r\n                     Index Cond: ((col_varchar_key)::text = 'i'::text)\r\n               ->  Bitmap Index Scan on t1_col_int_key_idx\r\n                     Index Cond: (col_int_key = ANY ('{134,170}'::integer[]))\r\n   ->  YB Bitmap Table Scan on t1 table2\r\n         Filter: ((((col_varchar_nokey)::text > (table1.col_varchar_key)::text) OR (pk <> table1.col_int_nokey)) AND ((((table1.col_varchar_key)::text = 'i'::text) AND (table1.col_int_key = pk)) OR ((table1.pk = col_int_key) AND (table1.col_int_key = ANY ('{134,170}'::integer[])))))\r\n         ->  BitmapOr\r\n               ->  Bitmap Index Scan on t1_pkey\r\n                     Index Cond: (table1.col_int_key = pk)\r\n               ->  Bitmap Index Scan on t1_col_int_key_idx\r\n                     Index Cond: (table1.pk = col_int_key)\r\n(14 rows)\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/2087029717/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"timothy-e","id":26841748,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxNzQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841748?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e","html_url":"https://github.com/timothy-e","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/followers","following_url":"https://ap