"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-11036](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-11036)\r\n### Description\n\n```sql\r\nEXPLAIN (COSTS OFF)  /*+ Set(enable_seqscan OFF) Set(enable_hashagg OFF) */ SELECT table1.pk AS field1, table2.col_int_key AS field2 FROM ( CC AS table1 RIGHT JOIN ( ( C AS table2 INNER JOIN CC AS table3 ON (( table3.pk <> table2.pk ) AND (table3.pk != table2.pk ) ) ) ) ON (( table3.pk > table2.col_int_key ) AND (table3.pk <> table2.col_int_nokey ) ) ) WHERE ( table3.col_varchar_nokey <> table2.col_varchar_key AND table1.pk BETWEEN 251 AND ( 55 + 207 ) AND ( table1.col_int_nokey < table3.col_int_nokey AND ( table1.col_varchar_key > 'n' OR table1.col_varchar_key <> 'g' ) AND ( table1.col_int_key = table3.col_int_key OR ( table1.pk > table3.pk AND table1.pk IS NULL ) AND table1.col_varchar_nokey IS NULL ) ) ) GROUP BY table1.pk, table2.col_int_key;\r\n```\r\n\r\nplan (the issue does not reproduce when pushdown is disabled, but the plan should be mostly the same):\r\n```sql\r\nset yb_enable_expression_pushdown = false;\r\nEXPLAIN (COSTS OFF)  /*+ Set(enable_seqscan OFF) Set(enable_hashagg OFF) */ SELECT table1.pk AS field1, table2.col_int_key AS field2 FROM ( CC AS table1 RIGHT JOIN ( ( C AS table2 INNER JOIN CC AS table3 ON (( table3.pk <> table2.pk ) AND (table3.pk != table2.pk ) ) ) ) ON (( table3.pk > table2.col_int_key ) AND (table3.pk <> table2.col_int_nokey ) ) ) WHERE ( table3.col_varchar_nokey <> table2.col_varchar_key AND table1.pk BETWEEN 251 AND ( 55 + 207 ) AND ( table1.col_int_nokey < table3.col_int_nokey AND ( table1.col_varchar_key > 'n' OR table1.col_varchar_key <> 'g' ) AND ( table1.col_int_key = table3.col_int_key OR ( table1.pk > table3.pk AND table1.pk IS NULL ) AND table1.col_varchar_nokey IS NULL ) ) ) GROUP BY table1.pk, table2.col_int_key;\r\n                                                                                                QUERY PLAN\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n Group\r\n   Group Key: table1.pk, table2.col_int_key\r\n   ->  Sort\r\n         Sort Key: table1.pk, table2.col_int_key\r\n         ->  Nested Loop\r\n               ->  Nested Loop\r\n                     ->  Index Scan using cc_pkey on cc table1\r\n                           Index Cond: ((pk >= 251) AND (pk <= 262))\r\n                           Filter: (((col_varchar_key)::text > 'n'::text) OR ((col_varchar_key)::text <> 'g'::text))\r\n                     ->  YB Bitmap Table Scan on cc table3\r\n                           Filter: ((table1.col_int_nokey < col_int_nokey) AND ((table1.col_int_key = col_int_key) OR ((table1.pk > pk) AND (table1.pk IS NULL) AND (table1.col_varchar_nokey IS NULL))))\r\n                           ->  BitmapOr\r\n                                 ->  Bitmap Index Scan on cc_int_key\r\n                                       Index Cond: (table1.col_int_key = col_int_key)\r\n                                 ->  Bitmap Index Scan on cc_pkey\r\n                                       Index Cond: (table1.pk > pk)\r\n               ->  Index Scan using c_int_key on c table2\r\n                     Index Cond: (table3.pk > col_int_key)\r\n                     Filter: ((table3.pk <> pk) AND (table3.pk <> pk) AND (table3.pk <> col_int_nokey) AND ((table3.col_varchar_nokey)::text <> (col_varchar_key)::text))\r\n(19 rows)\r\n```\r\n\r\n[dump.txt](https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/files/15069443/dump.txt)\r\n\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-11036]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-11036?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yuga